WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:08.368
In this video, you will change the name and description of your entry, and then see how to take your home out of a contest, if you ever need to.

00:00:08.368 --> 00:00:09.467
We start on the map.

00:00:10.366 --> 00:00:12.115
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.537
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:19.331 --> 00:00:20.313
Then tap Allow.

00:00:24.199 --> 00:00:27.436
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:27.436 --> 00:00:30.262
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:30.262 --> 00:00:35.029
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:35.029 --> 00:00:35.441
Tap it.

00:00:37.051 --> 00:00:38.950
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:44.023
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:44.723 --> 00:00:45.338
Tap Mine.

00:00:45.338 --> 00:00:50.077
Under Homes you entered, you will find your entry, and the contest it is in.

00:00:50.077 --> 00:00:51.123
Tap Open contest.

00:00:52.809 --> 00:00:54.153
Tap Open contest.

00:00:56.214 --> 00:00:58.042
Find the card called Your home.

00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:00.154
This is where you manage your entry.

00:01:00.154 --> 00:01:01.868
Tap Edit name and description.

00:01:03.545 --> 00:01:06.660
Change the name, or add a better description, then tap Save.

00:01:09.693 --> 00:01:12.573
You can do this any time while the contest is open.

00:01:13.474 --> 00:01:16.887
If you ever need to take your home out of the contest, tap Withdraw.

00:01:18.564 --> 00:01:21.786
It asks you to tap again, so you cannot do it by accident.

00:01:23.599 --> 00:01:26.585
Once you do, your home leaves the contest and the map.

00:01:27.488 --> 00:01:29.002
Next up: Your profile.
